  "description": "Forget the rules. With the Blend Gravel, you decide where to go. It’s light and flexible, fast and stable – an aluminium gravel bike where everything comes together: Affordable for those just starting out. Comfortable to keep you engaged. Nice and clean, so you can shine – whether on adventures together or everyday journeys. Highlights: • Carbon fork – less weight and more comfort • 40 mm tyre clearance – suitable for road and gravel tyres • Hydraulic disc brakes – safe braking without compromise • Integrated cable routing – a clean look and more space on the handlebar • Mounting points¹ for top tube bags – your essentials always to hand • Ready for everyday life – mudguard and kickstand separately available • UDH mounting standard – future-proof for all shifting systems The Blend Gravel comes with the Shimano GRX 400 groupset featuring 2x10 gears – versatile, robust and ideal for beginners. Gravel bike tyres from Continental and G20 aluminium wheels combine grip, comfort and stability. The slim Selle Italia saddle offers a sporty fit and remains comfortable for a long time. Get on and let’s go. Weight: approx. 10.2 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for violet frame, size M, without pedals. ¹ from model year 2026 (violet/light ochre)",
